# Origamic prompts: http://...
# Generate code from this with: npx origamic gen

GetFoo:
  Hello $name,

  What's up $name?

  Context: $context

  Make sure to match this schema:
  $<schema hide>
    interface FullName {
      firstName: string;
      lastName: string;
      foo: {
        x?: number;
        y?: boolean;
        foos: string[];
        kind: "z";
        abc: "a" | "b" | "c";
      };
    }

    type Response = FullName[];
  $</schema>

  For example:
  $<example>
    [
      {
        "firstName": "Jane",
        "lastName": "Do",
        ...
      },
      {
        "firstName": "John",
        "lastName": "Do",
        ...
      },
      {...},
      ...
    ]
  $</example>

GetName:
  Hi
